_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":12,"closed_issues":3,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-11-12T07:00:50Z","updated_at":"2026-11-17T07:41:37Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-10-27T03:15:13Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T01:09:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"status":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":5,"completed":1,"percent_completed":20},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/1817","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":3,"total_blocking":4},"body":"# Hardware inventory & first-node selection\n\n## Purpose\nKnow exactly what hardware exists, in what condition, so the first 3-5 cluster nodes are picked on evidence instead of memory.\n\n## Scope\nGather full hardware stats for all ~12 Threadripper machines (CPU, board, RAM, every NVMe/HDD with model + SMART, NICs, GPUs). Note the 8 HDDs still in the box (no baseline data exists yet). Rank machines by identical-ness and drive quality and name the first 3-5 cluster nodes and their order.\n\n## Execution mode\nHybrid: the inventory design, templates, and analysis are online; gathering stats needs machines powered and reachable (physical), or BMC/KVM access once cabled.\n\n## Dependencies\nFeeds every other epic. Node selection gates epics 5 and 6.\n\n## Acceptance\nA committed inventory (one record per machine) covering every machine and drive; a named, ordered first-node list with the reasoning recorded; open questions (exact NIC spec, switch gear) either answered or filed as task issues.\n\n## Structure\n\nPart of the basement cluster program. Project home: `planning/roadmaps/basement-cluster.md` in this repo. Full program register: goal workspace `files/idea-register-2026-10-20.md` (Muse goal `goal_ba17a5777c21`). Detailed task issues are filed as sub-issues of this epic; dependencies use blocks / blocked-by links.\n\nHard rules for the whole program: no HashiCorp anything; everything bootstrappable from config, no hand-built state.\n\n<!-- hands:v1 kind=physical action=\"Power on one Threadripper host and make its BMC/KVM reachable to the worker.\" -->","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/1080/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/1080/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}